# Enforces LF line endings for these file types at the repository level,
# regardless of any individual machine's git config (core.autocrlf) or
# editor settings. This has caused repeated CI failures (gofmt requires LF)
# from files edited on Windows — this file makes the requirement explicit
# and version-controlled rather than dependent on local config.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.go text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary files — never attempt line-ending conversion
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary